<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-YAKIN LEAVES GRASSHOPPER FOR STUTTGART.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YAKIN LEAVES GRASSHOPPER FOR STUTTGART.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zurich Grasshopper's Swiss international midfielder Murat Yakin is joining German first division club Stuttgart, the Swiss news agency ATS said on Friday.</p>
<p>Several teams, including English premier league Arsenal, had expressed an interest in Yakin who has been capped nine times.</p>
<p>He is expected to sign a four-year contract within the next few days.</p>
